      "writtenOn": "2026-05-05T14:03:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e What about operand A and B?\n\nAdded support for ECEO(operand B write). I currently extract ecmd out of val before checking if the cmd is supported. Did you mean to validate all values of operand A and B?\nB is always zero in current intel iommu driver code, but validating operand A would need more logic.",
      "parentUuid": "f4d22546_e13abe29",
      "revId": "8b67ea1df759cc6c5053d8e539aad8bd019d7929",
